  <h2>How corrections are handled</h2>
  <p>When a model-year or market conflict is found, the reference should identify the conflict and defer to the vehicle's VIN-specific information. Do not silently blend data from adjacent model years, hybrid variants, different engines, or different transmissions.</p>
  <p>Before performing a repair, independently verify the latest applicable Volvo procedure, parts, torque values, and safety instructions. This website is an index and owner notebook, not authorization to perform a repair.</p>
